   "workflow": "87a56fa4-9b20-4e25-82cb-24d353027e89",
   "wf": "1.03 Emails",
   "audience": "post_ticket",
   "channel": "email",
   "num": 10,
   "step_id": "e1acfa42-7c2e-4ddf-b346-17eb17f7c7e8",
   "name": "Email - Nov 17 Ticket Holder",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-11-17",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "(WC6) - The People Who Pay for Your Decisions…"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "cae5e444-b52b-42d7-a46e-bec7eed12866",
   "wf": "0.0 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 1,
   "step_id": "a6652b9c-2e38-43c3-834e-6f09cb3ce902",
   "name": "Day 1",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-10-18",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "There is one final piece of this story I haven't told you. Read it:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "cae5e444-b52b-42d7-a46e-bec7eed12866",
   "wf": "0.0 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 2,
   "step_id": "e0e6d69d-a91b-4205-872f-1ac910e4332f",
   "name": "Day 2",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-10-19",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "I didn't spend 14 years building Warrior to talk about the good old days. Read this:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "cae5e444-b52b-42d7-a46e-bec7eed12866",
   "wf": "0.0 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 3,
   "step_id": "ac76641e-49ae-42c3-af9c-ab7e80cd2188",
   "name": "Day 3",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-10-20",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "The most powerful version of Warrior has never been taught publicly. Read why:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "cae5e444-b52b-42d7-a46e-bec7eed12866",
   "wf": "0.0 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 4,
   "step_id": "4d8707c2-1603-4d59-a50a-5362ce9b8337",
   "name": "Day 4",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-10-21",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "The Code was never the destination. After 14 years I see what I missed. Read it:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "cae5e444-b52b-42d7-a46e-bec7eed12866",
   "wf": "0.0 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 5,
   "step_id": "fb8db4bf-13cf-478f-814f-a71dc7eade96",
   "name": "Day 5",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-10-22",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "Most men never win their Impossible Game. They never built one they can win. Read why:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "cae5e444-b52b-42d7-a46e-bec7eed12866",
   "wf": "0.0 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 6,
   "step_id": "32197364-02c6-4ae7-a7f3-fe3b2144ae94",
   "name": "Day 6",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-10-23",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "What I've taught in private for 18 months, most of Warrior hasn't seen. Read it:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "cae5e444-b52b-42d7-a46e-bec7eed12866",
   "wf": "0.0 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 7,
   "step_id": "25382396-797b-49b8-ae6b-54ecef52017d",
   "name": "Day 7",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-10-24",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "You don't need another breakthrough. You need a game. Here's the difference:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "cae5e444-b52b-42d7-a46e-bec7eed12866",
   "wf": "0.0 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 8,
   "step_id": "d45ffb83-b3d8-49af-bc59-0dcc4b1e116e",
   "name": "Day 8",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-10-25",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "Another AI tool? I get it. Read why this one is different:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "cae5e444-b52b-42d7-a46e-bec7eed12866",
   "wf": "0.0 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 9,
   "step_id": "452f8e88-b071-45d6-8d64-32887d670b2a",
   "name": "Day 9",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-10-26",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "What if your Stack could talk back? Read what I built:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "cae5e444-b52b-42d7-a46e-bec7eed12866",
   "wf": "0.0 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 10,
   "step_id": "cd09bdb4-1612-49a6-9192-e825882a8b15",
   "name": "Day 10",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-10-27",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "Your WarriorCon experience begins the moment you register. Read how:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "cae5e444-b52b-42d7-a46e-bec7eed12866",
   "wf": "0.0 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 11,
   "step_id": "b1dacc39-1ca6-43ce-b8fc-a25d446c482d",
   "name": "Day 11",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-10-28",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "The problem was never a lack of tools. Read what I found:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "cae5e444-b52b-42d7-a46e-bec7eed12866",
   "wf": "0.0 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 12,
   "step_id": "097d6173-9f93-4e6a-af33-c9bebbeb7025",
   "name": "Day 12",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-10-29",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "I don't want to give you another experience. I want to help you build something:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "cae5e444-b52b-42d7-a46e-bec7eed12866",
   "wf": "0.0 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 13,
   "step_id": "c2871698-6555-4564-bf14-80e058cc9b8a",
   "name": "Day 13",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-10-30",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "I became a prisoner of the movement I built to set men free. Read this:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "cae5e444-b52b-42d7-a46e-bec7eed12866",
   "wf": "0.0 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 14,
   "step_id": "710f1f07-5a6e-4abd-95e2-1b129d9ef3ff",
   "name": "Day 14",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-10-31",
    "time_et": "11:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "Thank you for 14 years. Here's my final invitation to the brotherhood:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "9113e15e-11ed-4cc4-913d-641d92cd8d30",
   "wf": "0.1 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 1,
   "step_id": "920c8911-530f-4dc0-9abd-d75434325f2c",
   "name": "SMS 1 (wc-day15)",
   "branch": "Not a buyer",
   "when": {
    "type": "on_enrollment"
   },
   "text": "There's a decision you've been avoiding. And you already know what it is. Read it:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "9113e15e-11ed-4cc4-913d-641d92cd8d30",
   "wf": "0.1 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 2,
   "step_id": "21f9c6f6-be41-49ed-b67f-eac803fae4d8",
   "name": "SMS 2 (wc-day16)",
   "branch": "Not a buyer",
   "when": {
    "type": "with_previous"
   },
   "text": "Most men calculate the cost of deciding. Few calculate the cost of doing nothing. Read it:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "9113e15e-11ed-4cc4-913d-641d92cd8d30",
   "wf": "0.1 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 3,
   "step_id": "529a5e16-e164-4fe1-9433-92e709a443e7",
   "name": "SMS 3 (wc-day17)",
   "branch": "Not a buyer",
   "when": {
    "type": "after_previous",
    "hours": 24
   },
   "text": "You keep trying to win a new game with an old strategy. Read why:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "9113e15e-11ed-4cc4-913d-641d92cd8d30",
   "wf": "0.1 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 4,
   "step_id": "f99f96f7-7b02-4dc7-9ff5-ebc7d048c970",
   "name": "SMS 4 (wc-day18)",
   "branch": "Not a buyer",
   "when": {
    "type": "after_previous",
    "hours": 24
   },
   "text": "Insight without execution becomes another form of avoidance. Read it:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "9113e15e-11ed-4cc4-913d-641d92cd8d30",
   "wf": "0.1 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 5,
   "step_id": "458cf238-f25a-4b6b-94cb-5609fd2a9b7c",
   "name": "SMS 5 (wc-day19)",
   "branch": "Not a buyer",
   "when": {
    "type": "after_previous",
    "hours": 24
   },
   "text": "Who must you become to live the life you say you want? Read it:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "9113e15e-11ed-4cc4-913d-641d92cd8d30",
   "wf": "0.1 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 6,
   "step_id": "8c08c053-2597-41df-99c5-f8efbc8d6246",
   "name": "SMS 6 (wc-day20)",
   "branch": "Not a buyer",
   "when": {
    "type": "after_previous",
    "hours": 24
   },
   "text": "What if the next 12 weeks changed the direction of your entire life? Read it:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "9113e15e-11ed-4cc4-913d-641d92cd8d30",
   "wf": "0.1 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 7,
   "step_id": "bd3fc94b-e072-4cf7-bd22-95b14739241b",
   "name": "SMS 7 (wc-day21)",
   "branch": "Not a buyer",
   "when": {
    "type": "after_previous",
    "hours": 24
   },
   "text": "What if the problem isn't that you don't know what to do? Read it:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "9113e15e-11ed-4cc4-913d-641d92cd8d30",
   "wf": "0.1 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 8,
   "step_id": "5a238a32-7fe6-47f0-9b92-53faa49999a0",
   "name": "SMS 8 (wc-day22)",
   "branch": "Not a buyer",
   "when": {
    "type": "after_previous",
    "hours": 24
   },
   "text": "He had enough money to never work again. But he couldn't stop working. Read his story:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "9113e15e-11ed-4cc4-913d-641d92cd8d30",
   "wf": "0.1 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 9,
   "step_id": "48e04fd6-5649-4152-9d59-69c0ce507313",
   "name": "SMS 9 (wc-day26)",
   "branch": "Not a buyer",
   "when": {
    "type": "after_previous",
    "hours": 24
   },
   "text": "He spent his life building other men's empires. Read his story:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "9113e15e-11ed-4cc4-913d-641d92cd8d30",
   "wf": "0.1 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 10,
   "step_id": "3115c4a0-d883-4ccb-a00e-ad85cc3a9bc0",
   "name": "SMS 10 (wc-day27)",
   "branch": "Not a buyer",
   "when": {
    "type": "after_previous",
    "hours": 24
   },
   "text": "The world celebrates what a man produces. But nobody sees what he's carrying. Read his story:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "9113e15e-11ed-4cc4-913d-641d92cd8d30",
   "wf": "0.1 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 11,
   "step_id": "1591a126-6eac-450a-90ae-2e4431faa497",
   "name": "SMS 11 (wc-day28)",
   "branch": "Not a buyer",
   "when": {
    "type": "after_previous",
    "hours": 24
   },
   "text": "He had no idea his wife was about to get leukemia. Read his story:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "9113e15e-11ed-4cc4-913d-641d92cd8d30",
   "wf": "0.1 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 12,
   "step_id": "c2604f6e-11ec-4388-89e6-ad0f11a49e3a",
   "name": "SMS 12 (wc-day29)",
   "branch": "Not a buyer",
   "when": {
    "type": "after_previous",
    "hours": 24
   },
   "text": "You can insure your house. You can insure your business. You can insure your life. Read it:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "9113e15e-11ed-4cc4-913d-641d92cd8d30",
   "wf": "0.1 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 13,
   "step_id": "1d1a6ecc-0bad-48ed-9e05-1ed85c9c2a45",
   "name": "SMS 13 (wc-day30)",
   "branch": "Not a buyer",
   "when": {
    "type": "after_previous",
    "hours": 24
   },
   "text": "You've heard their stories. What about yours? Read it:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "9113e15e-11ed-4cc4-913d-641d92cd8d30",
   "wf": "0.1 Texts",
   "audience": "promote",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 14,
   "step_id": "413a891e-c526-48ed-a925-b510f70b04e7",
   "name": "SMS 14 (wc-day31)",
   "branch": "Not a buyer",
   "when": {
    "type": "after_previous",
    "hours": 24
   },
   "text": "Making a decision doesn't change your life. Executing that decision does. Read it:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "ab0e73fd-f630-4da6-8678-1c00faa50e54",
   "wf": "1.04 Texts",
   "audience": "post_ticket",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 1,
   "step_id": "fb5a50ed-7643-491c-a016-c2ef5c20cfe5",
   "name": "SMS 1 - Nov 10 (wc-day23)",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-11-10",
    "time_et": "12:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "This is no longer about me. The greatest story was never mine. It was theirs. Read it:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "ab0e73fd-f630-4da6-8678-1c00faa50e54",
   "wf": "1.04 Texts",
   "audience": "post_ticket",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 2,
   "step_id": "aed4ea89-fc99-439c-91c2-517339eb21f9",
   "name": "SMS 2 - Nov 11 (wc-day24)",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-11-11",
    "time_et": "12:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "The most dangerous lie a man tells is the one he tells himself. Read it:"
  },
  {
   "workflow": "ab0e73fd-f630-4da6-8678-1c00faa50e54",
   "wf": "1.04 Texts",
   "audience": "post_ticket",
   "channel": "sms",
   "num": 3,
   "step_id": "c1dbc3b1-df7b-4a8d-afdc-1eba8e6e1f32",
   "name": "SMS 3 - Nov 12 (wc-day25)",
   "branch": "main",
   "when": {
    "type": "date",
    "date": "2026-11-12",
    "time_et": "12:30",
    "plus_hours": 0
   },
   "text": "Your results don't care about your excuses. They are telling a story. Read it:"
  }
 ]
}
